'''The Delicious Day with Pokémon''' (Simplified Chinese: '''{{lang|zh-cmn-Hans-CN|宝可梦来我家了}}''' ''Pokémon Came to My House'', Japanese: '''{{j|ポケモンたちとのおいしい一日}}''' ''The Delicious Day with Pokémon''), also known as '''Pokémon and Cat's Kitchen''' (Simplified Chinese: '''{{lang|zh-cmn-Hans-CN|宝可梦X日食记}}''' ''Pokémon × {{tt|Rishiji|Cat's Kitchen}}''), is a series of {{wp|Live-action animation|CGI live-action}} short videos featuring Sean Jiang, also known as Lao Dao, and his life with Pokémon. It was produced as a collaboration between [[The Pokémon Company]], Pokémon Shanghai, and the Chinese video creator team '''Cat's Kitchen''' (also known as '''Sean's Kitchen'''; Simplified Chinese: '''{{lang|zh-cmn-Hans-CN|日食记}}''' ''Rishiji'', Japanese: '''{{ruby|日食記|にっしょくき}}''' ''Nisshokuki'').

It consists of two seasons with three episodes each: '''Pokémon Sweets Paradise''' (Simplified Chinese: '''{{lang|zh-cmn-Hans-CN|日食记Pokemon宝可梦联名系列}}''' ''{{tt|Rishiji|Cat's Kitchen}} and Pokémon Series'', Japanese: '''{{j|ポケモンたちとの甘い冬}}''' ''Sweet Winter with Pokémon''), which was released on the Cat's Kitchen Bilibili, Weibo, and YouTube channel in Chinese from February 7 to 14, 2022, on the official Japanese Pokémon [[YouTube]] channel from February 15 to 22, 2022, and on the English [[Pokémon Kids TV]] YouTube channel from March 14 to May 13, 2022; and '''Camping Trip with Pokémon''' (Simplified Chinese: '''{{lang|zh-cmn-Hans-CN|家有宝可梦}}''' ''Pokémon at Home'', Japanese: '''{{j|ポケモンたちとのキャンプ旅}}''' ''Camping Trip with Pokémon''), which was released on the Cat's Kitchen Bilibili, Weibo, and YouTube channel in Chinese and on the official Japanese Pokémon YouTube channel from October 9 to 17, 2023, and on the English Pokémon Kids TV YouTube channel, Instagram, and Facebook from December 5 to 19, 2023.

As a tie-in to the animated shorts, a set of animated stickers and {{wp|GIF}}s based on the Pokémon seen in the shorts was released on [[LINE]] on April 30, 2024,<ref>[https://www.pokemon.co.jp/goods/2024/05/240517_ph01.html LINEスタンプ「ポケモンたちとのおいしい一日 スタンプ」が発売中｜ポケットモンスターオフィシャルサイト]</ref> on {{wp|Giphy}} on June 8, 2024,<ref>[https://sg.portal-pokemon.com/topics/apps/the_delicious_day_with_pokemon_stickers_are_now_available_on_giphy.html The delicious day with Pokémon Stickers are now available on GIPHY!]</ref> and on {{wp|Tenor (website)|Tenor}} on December 13, 2024.<ref>[https://sg.portal-pokemon.com/topics/event/the_delicious_day_with_pokemon_stickers_are_now_available_on_tenor_1.html The delicious day with Pokémon Stickers are now available on Tenor!]</ref>

